    <bpmn:process id="W_W3841" name="W3841. Product Knowledge Mastery Program &amp; Role-Based Knowledge Standards" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W3833); capability review
Frequency: Annual + maintained
Volume: Role/department knowledge standards
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising
Participants: Sales Enablement, Merchandising/Category (links to VS-01), Store Ops (links to VS-07), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Product Info (links to VS-01.3), Trade Capability (links to VS-123), Master Associates
Source: workflow W3841 — Product Knowledge Mastery Program &amp; Role-Based Knowledge Standards</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3841_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3841_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3841_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3841_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3841_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3841_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3841_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3841_Start3" name="Strategy (W3833); capability review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3841_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3841_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Merchandising define role-based product-knowledge mastery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Merchandising define role-based product-knowledge mastery standards per department/role (lumber, tiles, plumbing, electrical, paint, tools, appliances, hardware; cashier, sales associate, department supervisor, Pro-Desk): the must-know product attributes, applications, compatibility, common customer jobs, and selling points
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising / Master Associates
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3841_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3841_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3841_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Product-Info build the knowledge base from product information…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Product-Info build the knowledge base from product information (links to VS-01.3 PIM/W50, product content, specifications, SDS links to W1465), category expertise, and master-associate input, organized for quick floor reference (links to W3839)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising / Product Info
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3841_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3841_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3841_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/L&amp;D integrate the mastery standards into the competency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/L&amp;D integrate the mastery standards into the competency framework (links to VS-19.4/W683/W1127) and the apprenticeship curriculum where relevant (links to VS-123/W3810), and communicate expectations to associates
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3841_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3841_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3841_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3841_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3841_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-602 (ensure controlled execution — Product Knowledge Mastery, Certification &amp; Clienteling Tools (PA-124.2).) | - operational: role-based standards; operational: maintenance cycle
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3841_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3841_Annotation8" targetRef="W3841_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3841_Flow10" sourceRef="W3841_Start3" targetRef="W3841_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3841_Flow11" sourceRef="W3841_Task4" targetRef="W3841_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3841_Flow12" sourceRef="W3841_Task5" targetRef="W3841_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3841_Flow13" sourceRef="W3841_Task6" targetRef="W3841_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
