    <bpmn:process id="W_W3844" name="W3844. Clienteling Tool, Customer-360 &amp; Associate Mobile Selling Assistant" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Enablement-tech cycle (links to W3839); CRM maturity
Frequency: Maintained + continuous
Volume: Clienteling tool across ~200 stores
Owner: Sales Enablement / IT
Participants: Sales Enablement, IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), CRM/Loyalty (links to VS-13.3), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3844 — Clienteling Tool, Customer-360 &amp; Associate Mobile Selling Assistant</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3844_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3844_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3844_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3844_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3844_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3844_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3844_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3844_Start3" name="Enablement-tech cycle (links to W3839); CRM maturity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3844_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3844_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/IT deploy and operate the clienteling tool / associate mobile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/IT deploy and operate the clienteling tool / associate mobile selling assistant: a single customer view (profile, purchase history, loyalty tier/points, project/quote history links to VS-66/VS-11, preferences, last interactions) available to the associate at the point of sale, sourced from CRM/loyalty (links to VS-13.3) — enabling recognition, relevant recommendations, and follow-up
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / IT / CRM
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead / CIO
Duration: On project + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3844_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3844_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3844_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Store-Ops drive clienteling adoption: identify/recognize the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Store-Ops drive clienteling adoption: identify/recognize the customer (loyalty lookup, mobile number), use the customer-360 to personalize (recall last project, suggest replenishment/next-step), capture notes/tasks, and trigger follow-up (links to VS-13/W3845) — with RA 10173-compliant data handling (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3844_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3844_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3844_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics measure clienteling effectiveness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics measure clienteling effectiveness (customer-identification rate, repeat/attach uplift for identified customers, associate adoption — links to W3849) and improve the tool and practice
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics / IT
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3844_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3844_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3844_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3844_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
