      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loyalty strategy (links to VS-13); enablement cycle
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~2.8M monthly transactions across 600 POS
Owner: Sales Enablement / Loyalty
Participants: Sales Enablement, Loyalty/CRM (links to VS-13.2), Store Ops (links to VS-07), POS (links to VS-08), Marketing (links to VS-14), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Trade Pro (links to VS-43)
Source: workflow W3845 — Loyalty, Identification &amp; Enrollment Enablement at Point of Sale</bpmn:documentation>
