      <bpmn:userTask id="W3845_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Loyalty build the enablement to identify customers and enroll…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Loyalty build the enablement to identify customers and enroll loyalty members at POS: scripts/prompts, value props for enrollment, trade-pro identification (links to VS-43), and use of the customer-360 (links to W3844) — translating the loyalty program (links to VS-13.2) into associate behavior
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Loyalty / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3845_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3845_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3845_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Store-Ops coach and reinforce identification/enrollment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Store-Ops coach and reinforce identification/enrollment behavior on the floor, and address friction (slow POS lookup, weak value prop) with Loyalty/IT (links to VS-13/VS-08)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3845_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3845_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3845_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics track identification rate, enrollment conversion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics track identification rate, enrollment conversion, and loyalty-driven attach/basket uplift (links to W3849/VS-13.2), and report to commercial/loyalty governance
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics / Loyalty
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3845_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3845_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
