    <bpmn:process id="W_W3846" name="W3846. Service / Installation / Add-On Selling Enablement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Service strategy (links to VS-09/VS-12); enablement cycle
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Service/add-on attach enablement
Owner: Sales Enablement / In-Store Services
Participants: Sales Enablement, In-Store Services (links to VS-09), Installation (links to VS-12), Delivery (links to VS-06/VS-56), Warranty (links to VS-53), Project/Design (links to VS-66), Store Ops (links to VS-07), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4)
Source: workflow W3846 — Service / Installation / Add-On Selling Enablement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3846_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3846_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3846_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3846_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3846_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3846_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3846_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3846_Start3" name="Service strategy (links to VS-09/VS-12); enablement cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3846_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3846_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/In-Store-Services build enablement to sell and attach…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/In-Store-Services build enablement to sell and attach services/add-ons: fabrication (cut/thread — links to VS-09.1), paint tinting (links to W898), estimation (links to VS-09.2), installation (links to VS-12), delivery (links to VS-06/VS-56), extended warranty/protection (links to VS-53.3), and project/design consultation (links to VS-66) — when and how to surface each
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / In-Store Services
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3846_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3846_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3846_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Store-Ops coach associates on service/add-on attach triggers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Store-Ops coach associates on service/add-on attach triggers (e.g., appliance → installation + delivery + protection; paint → tinting + supplies; large project → estimation + design + delivery), and integrate into category playbooks (links to W3835)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3846_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3846_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3846_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics measure service/add-on attach rate and revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics measure service/add-on attach rate and revenue contribution per category/store (links to W3849/VS-09/VS-12), and prioritize high-value attach opportunities
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3846_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3846_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3846_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3846_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
