        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-602 (ensure controlled execution — Product Knowledge Mastery, Certification &amp; Clienteling Tools (PA-124.2).) | - operational: attach enablement; operational: standard triggers and estimation (links to VS-09)
Owner: Sales Enablement / In-Store Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
