    <bpmn:process id="W_W3848" name="W3848. Product Knowledge Content &amp; Vendor Training Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Content cycle; vendor training event
Frequency: Ongoing
Volume: Product-content &amp; vendor-training portfolio
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising
Participants: Sales Enablement, Merchandising (links to VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Retail Media (links to VS-48), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Compliance/ABC (links to VS-86.3), Legal (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3848 — Product Knowledge Content &amp; Vendor Training Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3848_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3848_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3848_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3848_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3848_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3848_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3848_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3848_Start3" name="Content cycle; vendor training event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3848_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3848_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Merchandising manage the product-knowledge content portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Merchandising manage the product-knowledge content portfolio: BuildRight-authored content (links to W3841), vendor-supplied product content, and retail-media-aligned content (links to VS-48), ensuring accuracy and consistency with PIM (links to VS-01.3)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3848_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3848_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3848_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Vendor-Mgmt govern vendor-led training and vendor-funded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Vendor-Mgmt govern vendor-led training and vendor-funded content: compliant with ABC (links to VS-86.3), brand-neutral (no improper brand preference — links to W3824), contractually documented (links to W688), and balanced across the assortment
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Vendor Mgmt / Compliance
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3848_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3848_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3848_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics measure content/vendor-training effectiveness and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics measure content/vendor-training effectiveness and knowledge outcomes (links to W3842/W3849), and report to merchandising/vendor scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3848_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3848_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3848_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3848_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3848_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-88 (ensure selling-quality &amp; training integrity.) | - operational: brand-neutrality and balanced content; operational: PIM linkage and content governance
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
